ced to eject to Earth while her father stays to protect the base. When Lou and Goh return to the base to keep it from crashing in Earth, they end up fighting the Mimetec to avenge Lou's father.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/80281/331060.jpg"},{"title":"The End of the Dream","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"1104","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1103","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1103","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"31711","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"80281","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"104193","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/80281/331061.jpg"},{"title":"Death by Reminiscing","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"1104","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1103","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1103","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"31711","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"80281","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"104194","synopsis":"The newly revived Max steals Myra away, leading to a confrontation with Goh, whom he blames for losing her in the first place.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/80281/331062.jpg"},{"title":"The Graceful Shooting Star","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"1104","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1103","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1103","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"31711","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"80281","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"